'''Prinplup''' (Japanese: '''ポッタイシ''' ''Pottaishi'') is a {{ct|Water}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion.

