==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Dark Explorers|Prinplup|28}} from the {{TCG|Dark Explorers}} expansion.
*'''Water Splash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Piplup|93}} from the {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

